                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="1a74-59f3-85ab-ecb7">This squad is an expert at taking AND holding down objectives long term. At the end of your Command Phase, while this unit is holding an objective, this unit&apos;s OC will continue to hold the objective, even if this unit leaves the area. This lingers until the enemy can match or beat the total OC held a this location.


Normal Reliquants in this unit now possess an OC of 2.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
